He scares me, okay.


00:04:44.159 --> 00:04:45.535
All right, I'll, uh...


00:04:46.244 --> 00:04:49.998
I'll go see him tomorrow.
I'll swing by at the end of the day.


00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:52.667
Thanks.


