00:45:40.655 --> 00:45:42.907
In case of what?
What are you talking about?


00:45:43.574 --> 00:45:46.619
I don't know.
If there was a break-in, or...


00:45:51.249 --> 00:45:52.333
Show me your arm.


00:45:54.043 --> 00:45:55.753
